text = "[b]Programming and game design[/b]
Nikola /NikX/ Dimitrov

[b]Used Resources[/b]
[b]3D Models:[/b]
• [url=https://poly.pizza/bundle/Ultimate-Space-Kit-YWh743lqGX]Ultimate Space Kit by Quaternius via Poly Pizza[/url]
• [url=https://quaternius.com/packs/stylizednaturemegakit.html]Stylized Nature MegaKit by Quaternius[/url]
• [url=https://poly.pizza/m/b3Kia9N2fS2/]Clouds by Jarlan Perez [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza[/url]
• [url=https://poly.pizza/m/mXKbcMPLSS]Turret by Kenney[/url]
• [url=https://poly.pizza/m/U8c6njvFry]Spacecraft Speeder by Kenney[/url]
• [url=https://poly.pizza/bundle/City-Kit-0CkvGrBJ0u]City Kit by Kenney via Poly Pizza[/url]
• [url=https://www.cgtrader.com/free-3d-models/space/other/cartoon-space-humster-astronaut-toy]Cartoon Space Hamster Astronaut Toy by spacepotato[/url]
• [url=https://poly.pizza/m/2WQIUVj5qr]Mirror by Isa Lousberg[/url]
• [url=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/]Hover Fighter: Beetle by Aaron Clifford [CC-BY][/url] via [url=https://poly.pizza/m/9teac58P9uv]Poly Pizza[/url]
• [url=https://tinytreats.itch.io/pretty-park]Tiny Treats - Pretty park set by TinyTreats & KayKit via itch.io[/url]
• [url=https://www.turbosquid.com/3d-models/lowpoly-stylized-hamster-2191765]Lowpoly stylized Hamster by Lucy_Sail via Turbosquid[/url]

[b]Textures:[/b]
• [url=https://www.vecteezy.com/png/21612232-cartoon-grass-leaves-clip-art]Cartoon grass leaves clip art Free PNG by Ovidiu Timplaru via Vecteezy[/url]
• [url=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/hamster_2372882?term=hamster&related_id=2372882]Hamster free icon by Smashicons via Flaticon[/url]
• [url=https://ambientcg.com/a/Pipe004]Pipe004 by ambientCG via ambientCG.com[/url]
• [url=https://ambientcg.com/a/Tape001]Tape001 by ambientCG via ambientCG.com[/url]
• [url=https://ambientcg.com/a/Tiles113]Tiles113 by ambientCG via ambientCG.com[/url]
• [url=https://kenney.nl/assets/1-bit-input-prompts-pixel-16]1-Bit Input Prompts Pixel 16× by Kenney via kenney.nl[/url]
• [url=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/focus-points_9736403?term=crosshair&page=1&position=87&related_id=9736403]Focus Points free icon by Fajrul Fitrianto via Flaticon[/url]
• [url=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/focus_12796947?term=crosshair&page=1&position=57&origin=search&related_id=12796947]Focus free icon by See Icons via Flaticon[/url]
• [url=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/first-aid-kit_862032?term=first-aid-kit&page=1&position=3&origin=search&related_id=862032]First Aid Kit free icon by Good Ware via Flaticon[/url]
• [url=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/turret_6754318?term=turret&page=1&position=2&origin=search&related_id=6754318]Turret free icon by juicy_fish via Flaticon[/url]
